{
  "id": "639",
  "title": "Reach 100, Get 20 Off",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2019-01-27",
  "synopsis": "Little Le is worrying about her weight, and Paul is not much help.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/936/0a26f6e9a2ef1092fdf026759f4e861da8098fb6.mp3?1545123043",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "满100减20\n\n    小乐和保罗在逛街买衣服。很多店家搞活动，上面写着：满88减10，满100减20。也就是买满88元减10元，买满100元减20元。\n    小乐看着看着，突然不高兴了。保罗问她怎么了，她说：“唉，为什么我的体重就不能满88减10，满100减20呢。这样我就不会上100斤了！”\n    保罗笑了，说：“哈哈！你的体重像充话费。充话费不是经常有‘充100送20’的吗？”",
    "traditional": "滿100減20\n\n    小樂和保羅在逛街買衣服。很多店家搞活動，上面寫著：滿88減10，滿100減20。也就是買滿88元減10元，買滿100元減20元。\n    小樂看著看著，突然不高興了。保羅問她怎麼了，她說：“唉，為什麼我的體重就不能滿88減10，滿100減20呢。這樣我就不會上100斤了！”\n    保羅笑了，說：“哈哈！你的體重像充話費。充話費不是經常有‘充100送20’的嗎？”"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Reach 100, Get 20 Off"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小乐和保罗在逛街买衣服。",
      "traditional": "小樂和保羅在逛街買衣服。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè hé bǎo luó zài guàng jiē mǎi yī fu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "很多店家搞活动，上面写着：满88减10，满100减20。",
      "traditional": "很多店家搞活動，上面寫著：滿88減10，滿100減20。",
      "pinyin": "hěn duō diàn jiā gǎo huó dòng shàng miàn xiě zhe mǎn 3 jiǎn 1 mǎn 2 jiǎn 2",
      "english": "Little Le and Paul were out window-shopping for clothes."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "也就是买满88元减10元，买满100元减20元。",
      "traditional": "也就是買滿88元減10元，買滿100元減20元。",
      "pinyin": "yě jiù shì mǎi mǎn 3 yuán jiǎn 1 yuán mǎi mǎn 2 yuán jiǎn 2 yuán",
      "english": "A lot of shop owners ran campaigns and had written: Reach 88, get 10 off. Reach 100, get 20 off."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "In other words, buy for at least 88 yuan and get a 10 yuan discount. Buy for at least 100 yuan and get a 20 yuan discount."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小乐看着看着，突然不高兴了。",
      "traditional": "小樂看著看著，突然不高興了。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lè kàn zhe kàn zhe tū rán bù gāo xìng le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "保罗问她怎么了，她说：",
      "traditional": "保羅問她怎麼了，她說：",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó wèn tā zěn me le tā shuō",
      "english": "Little Le looked and looked, and suddenly seemed unhappy."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "“唉，为什么我的体重就不能满88减10，满100减20呢。这样我就不会上100斤了！”",
      "traditional": "“唉，為什麼我的體重就不能滿88減10，滿100減20呢。這樣我就不會上100斤了！”",
      "pinyin": "ài wèi shén me wǒ de tǐ zhòng jiù bù néng mǎn 3 jiǎn 1 mǎn 2 jiǎn 2 ne zhè yàng wǒ jiù bú huì shàng 2 jīn le",
      "english": "Paul asked what was wrong, and she said:"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "“Sigh, why can’t my body weight be ‘Reach 88, lose 10. Reach 100, lose 20.’ Then I would never go over 50 kg!”"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "保罗笑了，说：“哈哈！你的体重像充话费。",
      "traditional": "保羅笑了，說：“哈哈！你的體重像充話費。",
      "pinyin": "bǎo luó xiào le shuō hā hā nǐ de tǐ zhòng xiàng chōng huà fèi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "充话费不是经常有‘充100送20’的吗？”",
      "traditional": "充話費不是經常有‘充100送20’的嗎？”",
      "pinyin": "chōng huà fèi bú shì jīng cháng yǒu chōng 2 sòng 2 de ma",
      "english": "Paul laughed: “Haha! Your weight is like charging your phone credit.”"
    }
  ],
